{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PACK IT, SAIL IT, SELL IT\u2014PACK AGAIN\u2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RAFT DAYS COMBINES SOKOBAN PUZZLES WITH A TRADING SIMULATION.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LOAD ALL KINDS OF GOODS ONTO YOUR OWN RAFT AND TRAVEL THE WORLD!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enjoy laid-back days with a Sokoban puzzle \u00d7 trading simulation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set out onto the open sea on a pocket-sized raft with a little money and rations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve Sokoban-style puzzles at a relaxed pace to buy and sell goods and savor the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if you run out of food, you\u2019ll starve. Whether you load rations or cargo will put your judgment to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675920/extras/d51c05876d007783b2436d20d6c3e105.poster.avif?t=1760100372\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675920/extras/d51c05876d007783b2436d20d6c3e105.webm?t=1760100372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675920/extras/d51c05876d007783b2436d20d6c3e105.mp4?t=1760100372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You can\u2019t load everything. What will you do?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How you stow cargo on the raft is the key to keeping your long voyage going.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you push valuable goods too far to the back, you might not be able to sell them when you need to!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >After all, the basics of business are \u201cbuy low, sell high\u201d!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which goods you purchase is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful\u2014if you can\u2019t pay your taxes, your journey ends right there\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675920/extras/e626df929bfa9f649a293bab7ce844bb.poster.avif?t=1760100372\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675920/extras/e626df929bfa9f649a293bab7ce844bb.webm?t=1760100372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675920/extras/e626df929bfa9f649a293bab7ce844bb.mp4?t=1760100372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2693 Choose Your Own Destination \u2014 \u201cVoyage Mode\u201d Unlocked!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675920/extras/bc15677a8b363832dc2c16642c54074d.poster.avif?t=1760100372\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675920/extras/bc15677a8b363832dc2c16642c54074d.webm?t=1760100372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675920/extras/bc15677a8b363832dc2c16642c54074d.mp4?t=1760100372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the previous demo, destinations were limited to preset choices. Now, with <strong>Voyage Mode</strong>, you can freely sail through a <strong>randomly generated world</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which port will you visit? What goods will you trade? The choice is entirely yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Record Your Journey \u2014 \u201cWorld Map\u201d Feature Added!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675920/extras/bbe0c1f62290875e92414ab74b203e08.poster.avif?t=1760100372\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675920/extras/bbe0c1f62290875e92414ab74b203e08.webm?t=1760100372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675920/extras/bbe0c1f62290875e92414ab74b203e08.mp4?t=1760100372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every voyage you take in Voyage Mode will be recorded on your personal <strong>World Map</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail toward unknown horizons \u2014 will you discover every port at the edge of the world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcd8 Discover and Collect \u2014 \u201cEncyclopedia\u201d Feature Added!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675920/extras/53051f9ac0a62d9ddde21637367ef25d.poster.avif?t=1760100372\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675920/extras/53051f9ac0a62d9ddde21637367ef25d.webm?t=1760100372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675920/extras/53051f9ac0a62d9ddde21637367ef25d.mp4?t=1760100372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the items you buy and sell will be recorded in your <strong>Encyclopedia</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete every page, and it will stand as <strong>proof of your travels across the world</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9 Deeper, Smarter, and More Challenging \u2014 The Evolved Puzzle Experience!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675920/extras/151c6d759f2c6b779c09560f9f7e011c.poster.avif?t=1760100372\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675920/extras/151c6d759f2c6b779c09560f9f7e011c.webm?t=1760100372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675920/extras/151c6d759f2c6b779c09560f9f7e011c.mp4?t=1760100372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ports now appear in <strong>varied shapes and layouts</strong> instead of being identical.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To trade successfully, you\u2019ll need not only your merchant\u2019s skill,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but also <strong>a sharp mind and clever strategy</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d Reaching More Players \u2014 Now Supports Chinese!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675920/extras/d501d60c112a4f57ce63bd41a028bfe3.poster.avif?t=1760100372\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675920/extras/d501d60c112a4f57ce63bd41a028bfe3.webm?t=1760100372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675920/extras/d501d60c112a4f57ce63bd41a028bfe3.mp4?t=1760100372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to Japanese and English, <i>RAFT Days</i> now supports <strong>Simplified Chinese!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re thrilled to share this adventure with even more players around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udea2 And the Voyage Continues</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even with so many improvements, this is still <strong>only the demo version</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ll continue developing <i>RAFT Days</i> based on your feedback, so please share your thoughts after playing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until then \u2014 <strong>fair winds and safe voyages!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3675920?t=1760100372","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3675920?t=1760100372","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675920/030c097941812f73d6576181257045e3963508d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760100372","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675920/030c097941812f73d6576181257045e3963508d0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760100372","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3728350,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PACK IT, SAIL IT, SELL IT\u2014PACK AGAIN\u2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RAFT DAYS COMBINES SOKOBAN PUZZLES WITH A TRADING SIMULATION.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LOAD ALL KINDS OF GOODS ONTO YOUR OWN RAFT AND TRAVEL THE WORLD!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enjoy laid-back days with a Sokoban puzzle \u00d7 trading simulation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set out onto the open sea on a pocket-sized raft with a little money and rations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve Sokoban-style puzzles at a relaxed pace to buy and sell goods and savor the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if you run out of food, you\u2019ll starve. Whether you load rations or cargo will put your judgment to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675920/extras/d51c05876d007783b2436d20d6c3e105.poster.avif?t=1760100372\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675920/extras/d51c05876d007783b2436d20d6c3e105.webm?t=1760100372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675920/extras/d51c05876d007783b2436d20d6c3e105.mp4?t=1760100372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You can\u2019t load everything. What will you do?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How you stow cargo on the raft is the key to keeping your long voyage going.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you push valuable goods too far to the back, you might not be able to sell them when you need to!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >After all, the basics of business are \u201cbuy low, sell high\u201d!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which goods you purchase is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful\u2014if you can\u2019t pay your taxes, your journey ends right there\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675920/extras/e626df929bfa9f649a293bab7ce844bb.poster.avif?t=1760100372\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675920/extras/e626df929bfa9f649a293bab7ce844bb.webm?t=1760100372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\