_item_assets/steam/apps/3675920/extras/bbe0c1f62290875e92414ab74b203e08.mp4?t=1760100372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every voyage you take in Voyage Mode will be recorded on your personal <strong>World Map</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail toward unknown horizons \u2014 will you discover every port at the edge of the world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcd8 Discover and Collect \u2014 \u201cEncyclopedia\u201d Feature Added!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675920/extras/53051f9ac0a62d9ddde21637367ef25d.poster.avif?t=1760100372\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675920/extras/53051f9ac0a62d9ddde21637367ef25d.webm?t=1760100372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675920/extras/53051f9ac0a62d9ddde21637367ef25d.mp4?t=1760100372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the items you buy and sell will be recorded in your <strong>Encyclopedia</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete every page, and it will stand as <strong>proof of your travels across the world</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9 Deeper, Smarter, and More Challenging \u2014 The Evolved Puzzle Experience!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675920/extras/151c6d759f2c6b779c09560f9f7e011c.poster.avif?t=1760100372\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675920/extras/151c6d759f2c6b779c09560f9f7e011c.webm?t=1760100372\" type=\"v